  m_text: "There\u2019s a mimic in this house.\r\nYou are a mimic hunter, and you\u2019ve
    received a call from a neighbor. The presence of mimics has been detected in
    five houses.\r\nMimic Behavior:\r\n- They only change position when you are not
    in the room.\r\n- They only change position if you have been in the room with
    them.\r\n- They can climb stairs and move between rooms.\r\n- They won\u2019t
    open doors unless there are more than two mimics in the house.\r\n- If a mimic
    sees you destroying objects, it will attack you.\r\n- If there is more than one
    mimic in the room, you need to force one to leave; killing one will make you
    the target of the other.\r\n- They can hide in drawers and wardrobes.\r\n- They
    make sounds when moving.\r\n- They won\u2019t move into a room if you are inside
    it or in an adjacent room with the connecting door open.\r\nControls:\r\n- Move:
    WASD\r\n- Move camera: Mouse\r\n- Charge shot: Hold left click\r\n- Shoot: Release
    left click after fully charging\r\n- Open/Close doors and furniture: E\r\n- Destroying
    a normal object will grant you a strike, 3 strikes in one house and you will
    get fired.\n- See this text: Hold Tab \n\nPress SPACE when you are \r\n"
